### Create user student
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/create/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Student3",
    "password": "student3",
    "first_name": "student3",
    "last_name": "student3",
    "email": "student3@gmail.com",
    "is_staff": false,
    "is_active": true,
    "role": "student"
}

